# Medieval woman (MAIDEN): 64x64. idle 0-4, walk 10-17, play harp 70-79, death 62-69; dance and curtsy rows left out.
# GandalfHardcore pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable on
# its own). The world view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips
# to face the heading. Action rows beyond idle/walk bake for later use.

sheet maiden.ppm
cell 64 64

bank MAIDEN
seq IDLE  loop ticks=4 : lin 0-4
seq WALK  loop ticks=2 : lin 10-17
seq HARP  loop ticks=4 : lin 70-79
seq DEATH once ticks=3 : lin 62-69
